# Corrections of public data (generated by scripts/overrides.mjs from the
# reference vocabulary, then reviewed). An override concept replaces what
# Wiktionary/Wikidata say about its word; every other word is learned from
# public data while the translator runs.

# public data: девушка, служанка
concept girl
  grounded-in Q3031
  class person
  en noun girl
  ru noun девочка f anim

